Association StudentSpecialEducationProgramAssociation based on StudentProgramAssociation
    documentation 'This association represents the special education program(s) that a student 
                  'participates in or receives services from. The association is an extension of 
                  'the StudentProgramAssociation particular for special education programs.
    bool IdeaEligibility
        documentation 'Indicator of the eligibility of the student to receive special education 
                      'services according to the Individuals with Disabilities Education Act (IDEA).
        is optional
    descriptor SpecialEducationSetting
        documentation 'The major instructional setting (more than 50 percent of a student's special 
                      'education program).
        is optional
    include ServiceProvider
        documentation 'The Staff providing special education services to the Student.
        is optional collection
    shared decimal HoursPerWeek named SpecialEducationHoursPerWeek
        documentation 'The number of hours per week for special education instruction and therapy.
        is optional
    shared decimal HoursPerWeek named SchoolHoursPerWeek
        documentation 'Indicate the total number of hours of instructional time per week for the school 
                      'that the student attends.
        is optional
    bool MultiplyDisabled
        documentation 'Indicates whether the Student receiving special education and related services 
                      'has been designated as multiply disabled by the admission, review, and dismissal 
                      'committee as aligned with federal requirements.
        is optional
    bool MedicallyFragile
        documentation 'Indicates whether the Student receiving special education and related services is:
                      '
                      '1) in the age range of birth to 22 years, and
                      '
                      '2) has a serious, ongoing illness or a chronic condition that has lasted or is 
                      'anticipated to last at least 12 or more months or has required at least one 
                      'month of hospitalization, and that requires daily, ongoing medical treatments 
                      'and monitoring by appropriately trained personnel which may include parents or 
                      'other family members, and
                      '
                      '3) requires the routine use of medical device or of assistive technology to 
                      'compensate for the loss of usefulness of a body function needed to participate 
                      'in activities of daily living, and
                      '
                      '4) lives with ongoing threat to his or her continued well-being.
                      '
                      'Aligns with federal requirements.
        is optional
    date LastEvaluationDate
        documentation 'The date of the last special education evaluation.
        is optional
    date IEPReviewDate
        documentation 'The date of the last IEP review.
        is optional
    date IEPBeginDate
        documentation 'The effective date of the most recent IEP.
        is optional
    date IEPEndDate
        documentation 'The end date of the most recent IEP.
        is optional